  >>> tf.io.gfile.copy("/tmp/x", "/tmp/y")
  >>> tf.io.gfile.exists("/tmp/y")
  True
  >>> tf.io.gfile.remove("/tmp/y")

  You can also specify the URI scheme for selecting a different filesystem:

  >>> with open("/tmp/x", "w") as f:
  ...   f.write("asdf")
  ...
